{"intro":{"title":"Get to know PULS","afterTitle":"Start with your plans","step":1,"before":"<p class=\"branch-lead\">Financial wellbeing means feeling in control of your money today and being able to make choices about tomorrow.</p>\n    <div class=\"intro-notes\">\n      <section><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>Meeting everyday costs and having room for a surprise can reduce money stress. A plan gives you more choices when life changes.</p></section>\n      <section><h2>How PULS helps</h2><p>See how your banking activity, habits and knowledge shape your score. Then try one next step or test a goal before committing.</p></section>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-branch=\"goals\">Choose life goals <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div>","after":"<p class=\"branch-lead\">Choose what’s coming up in your life, then answer a few questions about your finances.</p><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-branch=\"goals\">Choose your plans <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div>"},"goals":{"title":"What’s coming up for you?","step":2,"before":"<p class=\"branch-lead\">Select all the goals you want to explore.</p>\n    <form id=\"branch-goals\">\n      <fieldset class=\"branch-goal-grid\"><legend class=\"sr-only\">Life goals</legend>\n        <label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"business\" >\n          <strong>Start or grow a business</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"buffer\" >\n          <strong>Build a cash buffer</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"inheritance\" >\n          <strong>Receive an inheritance</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"home\" >\n          <strong>Move home</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"family\" >\n          <strong>Prepare for a growing family</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"income\" checked>\n          <strong>Change jobs or take a break</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"university\" >\n          <strong>Go to university</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"salary\" >\n          <strong>Receive a first salary</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"travel\" >\n          <strong>Plan travel</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"marriage\" >\n          <strong>Get married</strong>\n        </label><label class=\"branch-goal\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"goal\" value=\"succession\" >\n          <strong>Plan family business succession</strong>\n        </label>\n      </fieldset>\n      <p class=\"message\" id=\"branch-error\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button quiet\" data-branch=\"intro\">Back</button>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"button\">Continue <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div>\n    </form>"},"timing":{"title":"When do you expect this change?","step":2,"before":"<p class=\"branch-lead\">Change jobs or take a break · Question 1 of 3</p><form id=\"branch-answer\"><fieldset class=\"branch-options\"><legend class=\"sr-only\">When do you expect this change?</legend><label class=\"branch-option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer\" value=\"soon\" required ><span>In the next three months</span></label><label class=\"branch-option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer\" value=\"year\" required ><span>In three to twelve months</span></label><label class=\"branch-option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer\" value=\"later\" required checked><span>In more than a year</span></label><label class=\"branch-option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer\" value=\"unsure\" required ><span>I’m still exploring</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button quiet\">Back</button><button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\">Continue <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div></form>"},"priorities":{"title":"What would make the change easier?","step":2,"before":"<p class=\"branch-lead\">Change jobs or take a break · Question 2 of 3</p><p class=\"question-hint\">Select all that apply.</p><form id=\"branch-answer\"><fieldset class=\"branch-options\"><legend class=\"sr-only\">What would make the change easier?</legend><label class=\"branch-option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer\" value=\"0\"  ><span>Cover essentials during a gap</span></label><label class=\"branch-option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer\" value=\"1\"  ><span>Get used to a different salary</span></label><label class=\"branch-option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer\" value=\"2\"  checked><span>Keep saving during the change</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button quiet\">Back</button><button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\">Continue <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div></form>"},"sources":{"title":"Add data sources","step":2,"before":"<div class=\"stack narrow-page sources-page\">\n    <h1 id=\"data-sources-title\">Add data sources</h1><p class=\"subtle\">Optional. Add another account, import a report or enter assets before opening your score.</p>\n    <div class=\"source-choices\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Ways to add data\">\n      <button type=\"button\" data-action=\"asset-mode\" data-id=\"bank\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Connect a bank</button><button type=\"button\" data-action=\"asset-mode\" data-id=\"csv\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Import a CSV</button><button type=\"button\" data-action=\"asset-mode\" data-id=\"manual\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Add manually</button>\n    </div>\n    \n    <section class=\"card stack\"><h2>Your added assets</h2>\n      <p class=\"subtle\">No additional assets yet.</p>\n    <p class=\"subtle\">The measured score uses your verified banking snapshot. Added assets are stored in this demo on this device.</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button \" data-action=\"finish-sources\" >View my PULS score</button></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>","after":"<div class=\"stack narrow-page sources-page sources-review\">\n    <h1 id=\"data-sources-title\">Add data sources</h1><p class=\"subtle\">Optional. Connect another account, import a CSV or enter assets manually.</p>\n    <div class=\"source-choices\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Ways to add data\">\n      <button type=\"button\" data-action=\"asset-mode\" data-id=\"bank\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Connect a bank</button><button type=\"button\" data-action=\"asset-mode\" data-id=\"csv\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Import a CSV</button><button type=\"button\" data-action=\"asset-mode\" data-id=\"manual\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Add manually</button>\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- REVIEW-05: Omit the empty asset container during onboarding; keep real added assets visible. -->\n    \n    <!-- REVIEW-05: Keep disclosure and score action outside the optional asset summary. -->\n    <p class=\"sources-disclosure subtle\">The measured score uses your verified banking snapshot. Added assets are stored in this demo on this device.</p>\n    <div class=\"sources-score\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button \" data-action=\"finish-sources\" >View my PULS score</button></div>\n  </div>"}}